if Joe Biden doesn't run. There&nbsp;
is a very interesting article&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.840 --> 00:00:26.720
in The Washington Post. Senator Bernie Sanders&nbsp;
is open to running for president in 2024 if&nbsp;&nbsp;

