campaign memo. A top political adviser distributed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:39.280
to allies on Wednesdays on Wednesday and shared&nbsp;
with The Washington Post quote In the event of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:39.280 --> 00:00:46.080
an open 2024 Democratic primary, Senator Sanders&nbsp;
has not ruled out another run for president, so we&nbsp;&nbsp;

